LQO's approach, steering PostgreSQL's own planner with its planner settings
rather than replacing it, follows published research, chiefly "Bao: Making
Learned Query Optimization Practical" (Marcus et al., SIGMOD 2021). LQO
contains no code from Bao or any other learned optimizer.
